```java
@Service
class OrderService {
    private final OrderRepository repo;
    OrderService(OrderRepository repo) { this.repo = repo; }
    void place(Order o) { repo.save(o); }
}

class OrderServiceTest {
    @Test
    void savesOrder() {
        OrderRepository mock = mock(OrderRepository.class); // no database
        OrderService service = new OrderService(mock);
        service.place(new Order(1L));
        verify(mock).save(any(Order.class)); // verify behaviour only
    }
}
```
Because the dependency is injected, the test creates the service with a mock and runs in milliseconds.

